# NMOX Studio release signing keys

Self-signed by decision (2026-08-27): official certificates —
Apple Developer ID + notarization, Windows Authenticode — are a
v3.0 milestone. Until then, releases are verifiable against the
keys below.

## Verifying a release

```bash
# 1. import the signing key (once)
curl -sL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NMOX/NMOX-Studio/main/KEYS | gpg --import
# 2. download SHA256SUMS + SHA256SUMS.asc from the release, then:
gpg --verify SHA256SUMS.asc SHA256SUMS
sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS --ignore-missing
```

